#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "Quick Reference"
msgstr "Quick Reference"

msgid "The workshop SO-101 robot and its lightbox workspace."
msgstr "Workshop의 SO-101 robot과 lightbox workspace입니다."

msgid ""
"Use one terminal in one `so101-workshop` container for the full workflow. Finish or stop each "
"exercise before running the next. Commands below run inside it unless labeled **host**. See [Get "
"the Code](06-get-the-code.md) for build requirements and mounts."
msgstr ""
"전체 workflow를 하나의 `so101-workshop` container terminal에서 진행합니다. 각 실습을 마치거나 종료한 뒤 다음 명령을 실행하세요. "
"**Host**라고 표시되지 않았다면 container 내부 명령입니다. Build 요구사항과 mount는 [Get the Code](06-get-the-code.md)를 "
"확인하세요."

msgid "Build and Start — Host"
msgstr "Build와 시작 — Host"

msgid ""
"Open a terminal on the host and change into the workshop folder in your home directory before "
"building or starting the container:"
msgstr "Host terminal에서 home directory의 workshop folder로 이동한 뒤 container를 build하거나 시작합니다."

msgid ""
"Keep the resulting container prompt open for all commands below. An extra shell is optional; see "
"[container shell recovery](container-shell-recovery) if you need to reconnect."
msgstr ""
"이후 명령을 위해 container prompt를 열어 두세요. 추가 shell은 선택 사항이며 재접속은 [container shell recovery](container-"
"shell-recovery)를 참고하세요."

msgid "Connect to a Running Container — Host"
msgstr "실행 중인 Container에 연결 — Host"

msgid "If the workshop container is already running, open a shell from a **host terminal**:"
msgstr "Container가 실행 중이면 **host terminal**에서 shell을 엽니다."

msgid ""
"To check whether it is running, optionally list running containers and look for `so101-workshop` "
"in the `NAMES` column:"
msgstr "필요하면 실행 중인 container 목록의 `NAMES`에서 `so101-workshop`을 확인합니다."

msgid "Identify and Calibrate Hardware"
msgstr "Hardware 확인과 Calibration"

msgid ""
"Inspect camera previews under `outputs/captured_images`. Replace these example assignments with "
"your station's values:"
msgstr "`outputs/captured_images`의 camera preview를 확인하고 아래 예시 값을 본인 station 값으로 바꾸세요."

msgid "`setenv` persists settings in mounted `docker/env`. New container shells load them automatically."
msgstr "`setenv`는 mount된 `docker/env`에 설정을 유지하며 새 container shell이 자동으로 읽습니다."

msgid "See [Calibration](07-calibrating-so101.md) and [Camera Setup](08-operating-so101.md#camera-setup)."
msgstr "[Calibration](07-calibrating-so101.md)과 [Camera Setup](08-operating-so101.md#camera-setup)을 확인하세요."

msgid ""
"For both arms, **skip wrist roll during the range sweep**; LeRobot sets its range automatically. "
"Still match the initial calibration pose."
msgstr ""
"두 arm 모두 **range sweep에서 wrist roll을 생략**합니다. LeRobot이 range를 자동 지정하지만 초기 calibration pose는 맞춰야 "
"합니다."

msgid "Manual Follower Control"
msgstr "Follower 수동 제어"

msgid ""
"Stop other robot-control processes first. Normal control moves to the initial pose and returns "
"home on exit:"
msgstr "먼저 다른 robot-control process를 종료합니다. 일반 control은 초기 pose로 이동하고 종료 시 home으로 복귀합니다."

msgid ""
"Add `--passive_mode=true` for hand-guiding with torque disabled, or `--rerun=true` for telemetry."
" For individual joint control:"
msgstr "Torque를 끄고 손으로 움직이려면 `--passive_mode=true`, telemetry는 `--rerun=true`를 추가합니다. Joint별 제어:"

msgid "Up/Down selects a joint, Left/Right moves it, Z commands zero, and Q/Escape exits."
msgstr "Up/Down으로 joint 선택, Left/Right로 이동, Z로 zero 명령, Q/Escape로 종료합니다."

msgid "Simulation and Recording"
msgstr "Simulation과 Recording"

msgid "Physics-only check:"
msgstr "Physics-only 검사:"

msgid "Teleoperation with both cameras:"
msgstr "두 camera를 사용하는 teleoperation:"

msgid ""
"Record (keep the username placeholder for local-only collection; use your own username if "
"uploading):"
msgstr "Recording(Local 수집은 username placeholder 유지, upload 시 본인 username 사용):"

msgid ""
"Focus [http://localhost:8090](http://localhost:8090): **Space** starts/saves, **C** discards, "
"**R** discards and resets. Wait for saving to finish before exiting. Add `--resume` to append to "
"the same dataset. Use only one browser tab connected to the viewer at a time."
msgstr ""
"[http://localhost:8090](http://localhost:8090)에 focus를 두고 **Space**로 시작/저장, **C**로 폐기, **R**로 폐기 "
"후 reset합니다. 저장이 끝난 뒤 종료하세요. 같은 dataset에 추가하려면 `--resume`을 사용하고 viewer에는 tab 하나만 연결합니다."

msgid "For later uploads to the same dataset, {ref}`refresh its tag <refresh-dataset-tag>`."
msgstr "같은 dataset에 나중에 다시 upload할 때는 {ref}`tag를 갱신하세요 <refresh-dataset-tag>`."

msgid "Automated Simulation Collection"
msgstr "자동 Simulation 수집"

msgid "Stop any running simulation client before starting another. Preview without recording:"
msgstr "다른 simulation client를 종료한 뒤 시작하세요. Recording 없이 preview:"

msgid ""
"Stop the preview with **Ctrl+C**, then collect 100 successful episodes with domain randomization."
" Keep the username placeholder if you do not plan to upload:"
msgstr ""
"**Ctrl+C**로 preview를 끝내고 Domain Randomization으로 성공 episode 100개를 수집합니다. Upload하지 않는다면 username "
"placeholder를 유지합니다."

msgid ""
"Wait for the target and final dataset export; this recorder stages episodes before assembling the"
" dataset. Then inspect and upload:"
msgstr "목표 달성과 최종 export를 기다리세요. Recorder는 episode를 임시 저장한 뒤 dataset을 조립합니다. 이후 검토하고 upload합니다."

msgid ""
"See [Automated Data Collection](08-simulation-teleoperation.md#optional-automated-data-"
"collection) for the complete sequence."
msgstr ""
"전체 순서는 [Automated Data Collection](08-simulation-teleoperation.md#optional-automated-data-"
"collection)을 확인하세요."

msgid "GR00T 1.7 Training and Evaluation"
msgstr "GR00T 1.7 학습과 평가"

msgid ""
"Use the complete [training command](10-groot.md#reference-post-train-your-own-model), with "
"`--policy.type=groot` and `--policy.base_model_path=nvidia/GR00T-N1.7-3B`."
msgstr ""
"전체 [학습 명령](10-groot.md#reference-post-train-your-own-model)에 `--policy.type=groot`와 "
"`--policy.base_model_path=nvidia/GR00T-N1.7-3B`를 사용합니다."

msgid ""
"Set `DATASET_NAME=so101_teleop_vials_newton` for the teleoperation example or "
"`DATASET_NAME=so101_auto_vials_newton` for automated collection. Define the model and output "
"variables after choosing the dataset. Training uses 20,000 steps, saves every 5,000 steps, and "
"writes under `outputs/train/<user>/<model>`; choose the single-GPU or multi-GPU command for your "
"machine."
msgstr ""
"Teleoperation은 `DATASET_NAME=so101_teleop_vials_newton`, 자동 수집은 "
"`DATASET_NAME=so101_auto_vials_newton`을 설정한 뒤 model/output 변수를 정의합니다. 20,000 step을 학습하고 5,000 "
"step마다 `outputs/train/<user>/<model>` 아래에 저장합니다. Machine에 맞는 single-GPU 또는 multi-GPU 명령을 선택하세요."

msgid "For sim evaluation, start the policy server once in the background of the same container terminal:"
msgstr "Simulation 평가용 policy server를 같은 container terminal의 background에서 한 번 시작합니다."

msgid ""
"After `Policy server ready`, select the course sim-only policy at the same prompt, or replace it "
"with your own checkpoint:"
msgstr "`Policy server ready` 후 같은 prompt에서 과정의 sim-only policy 또는 본인 checkpoint를 선택합니다."

msgid ""
"Use `your_hf_username/so101_auto_vials_newton_GR00T17` for the automated-data example, or set "
"`MODEL_ID` to the absolute path of a local `pretrained_model` directory. Keep using this "
"container shell."
msgstr ""
"자동 수집 예시는 `your_hf_username/so101_auto_vials_newton_GR00T17`, local checkpoint는 "
"`pretrained_model` directory의 절대 경로로 `MODEL_ID`를 설정합니다. 같은 container shell을 계속 사용하세요."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"See [Selected Policies](datasets-and-models.md#current-model-selection) for Johnny42, the 94% "
"simulation policy, and the co-trained checkpoint. See [Sim Evaluation](11-sim-evaluation.md) for "
"scoring and camera compatibility. For the physical robot, follow [Real Evaluation](run-the-"
"policy), which uses `lerobot-rollout` in this same container."
msgstr ""
"Johnny42, 94% simulation policy, Co-Trained checkpoint는 [Selected Policies](datasets-and-"
"models.md#current-model-selection)를 확인하세요. 채점과 camera 호환성은 [Sim Evaluation](11-sim-"
"evaluation.md), 실제 robot은 같은 container에서 `lerobot-rollout`을 사용하는 [Real Evaluation](run-the-"
"policy)을 따릅니다."

msgid ""
"`lerobot-rollout` moves to the dataset-derived starting pose specified in the evaluation command,"
" then waits for **P**. When changing models, also change `--start_pose_dataset` to the matching "
"training dataset."
msgstr ""
"`lerobot-rollout`은 `--start_pose_dataset`으로 지정한 dataset-derived pose로 이동한 뒤 **P**를 기다립니다. Model을 "
"바꾸면 대응하는 training dataset으로 해당 옵션도 바꾸세요."

msgid "Rollout controls"
msgstr "Rollout Control"

msgid ""
"The arm moves to the workshop start pose on startup, then waits for **P**. Keep the rollout "
"terminal focused. Keys are case-insensitive."
msgstr ""
"시작 시 arm이 workshop 시작 pose로 움직인 뒤 **P**를 기다립니다. Rollout terminal에 focus를 두세요. Key는 대소문자를 구분하지 "
"않습니다."

msgid ""
"Wait for `Paused` before rearranging props. On exit, wait for cleanup and any return motion to "
"finish before touching the arm."
msgstr "소품을 옮기기 전에 `Paused`를 기다리세요. 종료할 때도 cleanup과 복귀 동작이 끝난 뒤 arm을 만집니다."

msgid ""
"When comparing models, record the first-action delay shown in the terminal and the number of "
"successes out of scored trials."
msgstr "Model 비교 시 terminal에 표시되는 첫 action 지연과 평가한 trial 중 성공 수를 기록하세요."

msgid ""
"Wait for `Paused` before resetting props. Scored trials are saved when recording is enabled. The "
"default `workshop` strategy ignores `--duration`; end trials manually. See the [real rollout "
"instructions and controls](run-the-policy)."
msgstr ""
"소품 reset 전에 `Paused`를 기다립니다. Recording을 켜면 채점된 trial이 저장됩니다. 기본 `workshop` strategy는 "
"`--duration`을 무시하므로 직접 trial을 끝내세요. [실제 rollout 안내와 control](run-the-policy)을 참고하세요."

msgid ""
"After evaluation returns to the prompt, stop the background server before real rollout or "
"training:"
msgstr "평가가 prompt로 돌아오면 실제 rollout이나 학습 전에 background server를 종료합니다."

msgid "Or **stop all policy servers** in the container:"
msgstr "또는 container의 **모든 policy server를 종료**합니다."

msgid ""
"If server readiness fails, inspect `tail -n 40 outputs/policy-server.log` before retrying. See "
"[Sim Evaluation](11-sim-evaluation.md#run-policy-evaluation) for the full startup and cleanup "
"sequence."
msgstr ""
"Server가 준비되지 않으면 재시도 전에 `tail -n 40 outputs/policy-server.log`를 확인합니다. 전체 시작·종료 순서는 [Sim "
"Evaluation](11-sim-evaluation.md#run-policy-evaluation)을 보세요."

msgid "Common Issues"
msgstr "자주 발생하는 문제"

msgid "Symptom"
msgstr "증상"

msgid "Check"
msgstr "확인 사항"

msgid "All motors missing"
msgstr "모든 motor가 보이지 않음"

msgid "Correct arm power supply and connection"
msgstr "Arm에 맞는 전원과 연결 확인"

msgid "One motor missing"
msgstr "Motor 하나가 보이지 않음"

msgid "Motor cable and power cycle"
msgstr "Motor cable 확인 후 power cycle"

msgid "Camera or serial index changed"
msgstr "Camera 또는 serial index 변경"

msgid "Repeat detection and update saved settings"
msgstr "다시 탐지하고 저장 설정 갱신"

msgid "No simulated images"
msgstr "Simulation image가 없음"

msgid "Explicit `--cameras all presets=newton,ovrtx_renderer`"
msgstr "`--cameras all presets=newton,ovrtx_renderer` 명시"

msgid "Browser controls inactive"
msgstr "Browser control이 반응하지 않음"

msgid "Focus browser; use `--browser-display`"
msgstr "Browser focus와 `--browser-display` 확인"

msgid "Policy cannot connect"
msgstr "Policy 연결 실패"

msgid "Confirm background server readiness on port 8080; inspect `outputs/policy-server.log`"
msgstr "Port 8080의 background server 준비 상태와 `outputs/policy-server.log` 확인"

msgid "Dataset already exists"
msgstr "Dataset이 이미 존재함"

msgid "Use `--resume` or a different `--repo_id`"
msgstr "`--resume` 또는 다른 `--repo_id` 사용"

msgid "See [Troubleshooting](troubleshooting.md)."
msgstr "[Troubleshooting](troubleshooting.md)을 확인하세요."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "Key"
msgstr "Key"

msgid "Action"
msgstr "동작"

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "**P**"
msgstr "**P**"

msgid "**P for policy:** Start the first or next trial."
msgstr "**P for policy:** 첫 trial 또는 다음 trial을 시작합니다."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "**S / F**"
msgstr "**S / F**"

msgid "Score success/failure, return to the start pose, and pause."
msgstr "성공/실패를 기록하고 시작 pose로 복귀한 뒤 일시 정지합니다."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "**N / →**"
msgstr "**N / →**"

msgid "**N for next:** Discard the trial, return to the start pose, and pause."
msgstr "**N for next:** Trial을 폐기하고 시작 pose로 복귀한 뒤 일시 정지합니다."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "**Q / Esc**"
msgstr "**Q / Esc**"

msgid "**Q for Quit:** Exit and discard any unfinished trial."
msgstr "**Q for Quit:** 종료하며 미완료 trial은 폐기합니다."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "**Ctrl+C**"
msgstr "**Ctrl+C**"

msgid "Stop the rollout and run cleanup."
msgstr "Rollout을 중단하고 cleanup을 실행합니다."

